Why AGPL-3.0-only specifically
-------------------------------

GPLv3 and AGPLv3 are combinable (GPLv3 §13 / AGPLv3 §13 each grant
permission), but a combined GPLv3+AGPLv3 binary carries AGPL's
network-interaction obligation for that combination. Rather than rely on
that combination clause, `kovan` itself is licensed AGPL-3.0-only outright:
same license as `kopitiam-pdf`, so there is no cross-license combination
question to reason about at all.

