MuPDF provenance (one level further upstream)
-----------------------------------------------

`kopitiam-pdf`'s `mupdf` module is itself a close translation of MuPDF
(AGPL-3.0, (c) Artifex Software, Inc.), per that module's own doc comments
and `docs/ai-decisions/AID-0051-mupdf-port-conventions.md` /
`AID-0052-mupdf-c-delegation-substitutions.md` in the `kopitiam` repository.
This crate does not vendor or re-translate any of that — it consumes
`kopitiam-pdf`'s published, already-translated Rust as an ordinary
dependency.

