Workspace boundary (read before adding a dependency on `kovan`)
-------------------------------------------------------------------

`kovan` is, as of this relicense, the ONLY AGPL-3.0-only crate in the
`outram-park-backend` workspace. Every other member crate remains
GPL-3.0-only (or whatever license it already carried) and is UNAFFECTED by
this change: Cargo dependencies are scoped per-crate, not workspace-wide,
and `kopitiam-pdf` is declared only in this crate's own `Cargo.toml` — no
other crate in this workspace depends on it, directly or transitively.

This holds only as long as `kovan` stays a dependency LEAF: if any other
crate in this workspace adds `kovan` as a dependency (as a library, not as
an installed CLI binary), that crate's own compiled output becomes a
combined work incorporating AGPL-3.0-only code and inherits the same
question this NOTICE exists to document. Before adding `kovan` as a
dependency of another crate, re-read this NOTICE and re-confirm the
licensing consequence with the maintainer — do not assume it is free of
cost just because it worked for this crate.

