Translated code: jbt/markdown-editor (ISC) — added 2026-09-28
----------------------------------------------------------------

  Project:     markdown-editor, "Live (GitHub-Flavored) Markdown Editor"
  Repository:  https://github.com/jbt/markdown-editor
  Commit:      58aa8bfe18c5a30af2c6fb08221b00b841688dd9 (2020-05-03)
